{"title":"프레너미","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=xckGs/hAd4FUq3u2/MmfxQ68cptHmVKZ7dzG2qK&filename=th3","synopsis":"'하늘 아래 두개의 태양은 없...있다?!\n\n세계가 주목하는 테니스 천재 '강산'은\n전학 첫날 테니스를 그저 취미로\n즐기는 '주신이'를 만나게 된다.\n\n가벼운 마음으로 신청한 대결의 결과는\n'강산' 인생의 최대 굴욕적인 패배.\n타고난 재능으로 무패 행진을 거듭했던 '강산'의\n오만한 콧대는 산산조각이 난다.\n\n설욕을 다짐한 '강산'의\n'주신이'를 향한 집착은 날이 갈수록 커지는데...\n\n힘과 스피드로 상대를 짓누르는 파워 테니스 플레이어 '강산',\n그리고 지략과 컨트롤로 상대 약점을 파는 '주신이'!\n\n전혀 다른 색깔을 지닌 두 명의 천재가 만났다!\n'1년 뒤 그 날'의 있을 시합에서 과연 승자는 누가 될 것인가?!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":41,"change":{"type":"down","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":51,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":163,"change":{"type":"down","amount":112}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":121,"change":{"type":"up","amount":42}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":82,"change":{"type":"up","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":44,"change":{"type":"up","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":67,"change":{"type":"down","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":60,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":68,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":91,"change":{"type":"down","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":173,"change":{"type":"down","amount":82}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":115,"change":{"type":"up","amount":58}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":167,"change":{"type":"down","amount":52}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":168,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":192,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":94,"change":{"type":"up","amount":98}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":88,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":25,"change":{"type":"up","amount":63}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":155,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":211,"change":{"type":"down","amount":56}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":226,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":